# Replace authorId and ticketId with existing user and ticket IDs.
@authorId = 1
@ticketId = 1

### Create a comment (201 Created)
# @name createComment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "The worker logs are attached.",
    "authorId": {{authorId}},
    "ticketId": {{ticketId}}
}

### Fetch the created comment (200 OK)
GET {{createComment.response.headers.Location}}

### Unknown comment (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/comments/0

### Unknown author (404 Not Found)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "Content",
    "authorId": 9223372036854775807,
    "ticketId": {{ticketId}}
}

### Unknown ticket (404 Not Found)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "Content",
    "authorId": {{authorId}},
    "ticketId": 9223372036854775807
}

### Reject blank content (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "",
    "authorId": {{authorId}},
    "ticketId": {{ticketId}}
}
